## 环境要求

### 最小配置

- CPU: 4 核心
- 内存: 8 GB
- 存储: 50 GB SSD
- 操作系统: Linux (Ubuntu 20.04

+)

### 生产配置- CPU: 8+ 核心
- 内存: 16+ GB
- 存储: 200+ GB SSD (RAID 10)
- 操作系统: Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 LTS)

## 本地开发环境

### 1. 安装依赖

```bash
# 安装 Rust
curl --proto '=https' --tlsv1.2 -sSf https://sh.rustup.rs | sh

# 安装 MySQL
sudo apt install mysql-server

# 安装 Redis
sudo apt install redis-server

# 安装 NATS Server
wget https://github.com/nats-io/nats-server/releases/download/v2.10.0/nats-server-v2.10.0-linux-amd64.zip
unzip nats-server-v2.10.0-linux-amd64.zip
sudo cp nats-server-v2.10.0-linux-amd64/nats-server /usr/local/bin/
```

### 2. 初始化数据库

```bash
# 创建数据库
mysql -u root -p -e "CREATE DATABASE solsynth CHARACTER SET utf8mb4 COLLATE utf8mb4_unicode_ci;"

# 运行迁移
cargo run -p solsynth-db migrate
```

### 3. 配置环境变量

```bash
cp config/default.yaml config/local.yaml
```

编辑 `config/local.yaml`：

```yaml
server:
  host: "127.0.0.1"
  port: 8080

database:
  host: "127.0.0.1"
  port: 3306
  username: "root"
  password: ""
  database: "solsynth"

redis:
  url: "redis://127.0.0.1:6379"

nats:
  urls: ["nats://127.0.0.1:4222"]
```

### 4. 启动服务

```bash
# 启动 NATS
nats-server

# 启动 Redis
sudo systemctl start redis

# 启动 MySQL
sudo systemctl start mysql

# 启动主服务
cargo run -p solsynth

# 启动 API Gateway (另一个终端)
cargo run -p starfur-gateway
```

## Docker 部署

### 1. 构建镜像

```bash
# 构建所有服务
docker build -t solsynth:latest -f Dockerfile .

# 构建特定服务
docker build -t solsynth-auth:latest -f Dockerfiles/Dockerfile.auth .
docker build -t solsynth-gateway:latest -f Dockerfiles/Dockerfile.gateway .
```

### 2. Docker Compose

创建 `docker-compose.yml`:

```yaml
version: '3.8'

services:
  mysql:
    image: mysql:8.0
    environment:
      MYSQL_ROOT_PASSWORD: rootpassword
      MYSQL_DATABASE: solsynth
    volumes:
      - mysql_data:/var/lib/mysql
    ports:
      - "3306:3306"

  redis:
    image: redis:7-alpine
    ports:
      - "6379:6379"

  nats:
    image: nats:latest
    ports:
      - "4222:4222"

  solsynth:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: Dockerfile
    environment:
      DATABASE_URL: mysql://root:rootpassword@mysql:3306/solsynth
      REDIS_URL: redis://redis:6379
      NATS_URLS: nats://nats:4222
    depends_on:
      - mysql
      - redis
      - nats
    ports:
      - "8080:8080"

  gateway:
    build:
      context: .
      dockerfile: Dockerfiles/Dockerfile.gateway
    environment:
      UPSTREAM_URL: http://solsynth:8080
    depends_on:
      - solsynth
    ports:
      - "80:80"

volumes:
  mysql_data:
```

启动服务：

```bash
docker-compose up -d
```

## Kubernetes 部署

### 1. 创建命名空间

```bash
kubectl create namespace solsynth
```

### 2. 创建 ConfigMap

```yaml
# configmap.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: ConfigMap
metadata:
  name: solsynth-config
  namespace: solsynth
data:
  config.yaml: |
    server:
      host: "0.0.0.0"
      port: 8080
    database:
      host: "mysql"
      port: 3306
      username: "solsynth"
      database: "solsynth"
    redis:
      url: "redis://redis:6379"
    nats:
      urls: ["nats://nats:4222"]
```

### 3. 创建 Deployment

```yaml
# deployment.yaml
apiVersion: apps/v1
kind: Deployment
metadata:
  name: solsynth
  namespace: solsynth
spec:
  replicas: 3
  selector:
    matchLabels:
      app: solsynth
  template:
    metadata:
      labels:
        app: solsynth
    spec:
      containers:
      - name: solsynth
        image: solsynth:latest
        ports:
        - containerPort: 8080
        volumeMounts:
        - name: config
          mountPath: /app/config
      volumes:
      - name: config
        configMap:
          name: solsynth-config
```

### 4. 创建 Service

```yaml
# service.yaml
apiVersion: v1
kind: Service
metadata:
  name: solsynth
  namespace: solsynth
spec:
  selector:
    app: solsynth
  ports:
  - protocol: TCP
    port: 80
    targetPort: 8080
  type: LoadBalancer
```

### 5. 应用配置

```bash
kubectl apply -f configmap.yaml
kubectl apply -f deployment.yaml
kubectl apply -f service.yaml
```

## 配置说明

### 环境变量

| 变量 | 说明 | 默认值 |
|------|------|--------|
| `DATABASE_URL` | 数据库连接字符串 | `mysql://solsynth:solsynth@localhost:3306/solsynth` |
| `REDIS_URL` | Redis 连接字符串 | `redis://localhost:6379` |
| `NATS_URLS` | NATS 服务器地址 | `nats://localhost:4222` |
| `JWT_SECRET` | JWT 签名密钥 | 必需 |
| `FCM_PROJECT_ID` | Firebase 项目 ID | - |
| `FCM_CREDENTIALS` | Firebase 凭证 JSON | - |
| `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY` | Stripe 密钥 | - |

### 配置文件优先级

1. 环境变量 (最高)
2. `config/local.yaml`
3. `config/default.yaml` (最低)

